LargeST-derived data assets
---------------------------
The following files are geographic / identity metadata derived from the LargeST
benchmark dataset (`ca_meta.csv` and related sensor lists). They are **not**
covered by the MIT License of the ZipMix software. They remain subject to the
LargeST dataset license:

  Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International (CC BY-NC 4.0)
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/

Bundled derived assets:

  benchmarks/largest/assets/sd_meta.csv
  benchmarks/largest/assets/gba_meta.csv
  benchmarks/largest/assets/gla_meta.csv
  benchmarks/largest/prep/assets/reliable_nodes_sd.txt
  benchmarks/largest/prep/assets/reliable_nodes_gba.txt
  benchmarks/largest/prep/assets/reliable_nodes_gla.txt

Raw LargeST traffic time series (HDF / NPZ packs) are **not** shipped in this
repository. Obtain them from the official LargeST release and follow its terms.

